      <div type="clause" n="10">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:Swer">Swer</ref> 10</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">On lifiendes Godes naman, swa ic feos bidde, swa ic gywanan hæbbe ðæs, þe me N. behet, ða ic him min sealde.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">[I swear] in the name of the living God [that] I still lack what N. promised me, and demand payment for what I sold him.</ab>
        <ab type="supplementaryText" xml:lang="und">On lifiendes Godes naman, swa ic feos bidde, swa ic gywanan hæbbe ðæs, ðe me Ñ behet, ða ic him min sealde.</ab>
